cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its outputs, please cite both the software and the associated doctoral thesis."
title: "dengue_ctmc_spark_turkiye: A CTMC spark-phase model of dengue establishment in Türkiye under CMIP6 scenarios"
abstract: >-
  R pipeline for a continuous-time Markov chain (CTMC) spark-phase birth–death
  model estimating the probability that an imported dengue infection establishes
  local transmission across five sentinel districts in Türkiye under CMIP6
  SSP1-2.6, SSP2-4.5 and SSP5-8.5 scenarios (2025–2075). Includes climate
  bias-correction, importation-pressure construction, nested Monte Carlo
  simulation, two-stage verification, and sensitivity/regression analyses.
type: software
